 Power Rails
Connect the ESP32 to the breadboard power rails:
ESP32 3.3V  ─────► Breadboard + (Red Rail)

ESP32 GND   ─────► Breadboard - (Blue Rail)
For the servo, relay, and ULN2003 stepper driver, use the ESP32 5V/VIN pin:
ESP32 5V/VIN ───► Separate + Rail (or directly to these modules)

ESP32 GND ──────► Same GND rail
  OLED
OLED VCC  → +3.3V rail
OLED GND  → GND rail
OLED SDA  → GPIO21
OLED SCL  → GPIO22
